{"seq":1,"slug":"subduing-without-battle","title":"全胜思想：不战而屈人之兵","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/supreme-strategy/subduing-without-battle","wordCount":1796,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"全胜思想-不战而屈人之兵\">全胜思想：不战而屈人之兵</h1><p>&quot;全胜&quot;是孙子军事思想的顶层目标，集中见于《孙子兵法》第三篇《谋攻》。孙武在此篇开宗明义提出&quot;凡用兵之法，全国为上，破国次之&quot;，并以&quot;不战而屈人之兵，善之善者也&quot;作为用兵的最高标准。这一思想约形成于公元前 515—前 512 年（专诸刺吴王僚至阖闾三年孙武见吴王之间），距今约 2500 年，却在 1972 年山东临沂银雀山一号汉墓出土的西汉竹简本中得到完整印证，证明今本《谋攻》格局西汉初年已定型（<a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-hans/%E5%AD%99%E5%AD%90%E5%85%B5%E6%B3%95\">来源：维基百科·孙子兵法</a>）。</p>\n<p>本篇聚焦&quot;全胜&quot;这一战略目标本身；与之配套的<strong>手段层次</strong>（伐谋&gt;伐交&gt;伐兵&gt;攻城）在姊妹篇 <a href=\"attacking-strategy\">上兵伐谋</a> 中展开，不在此重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇的核心概念是&quot;全胜&quot;——以&quot;全&quot;与&quot;破&quot;这对标尺重新定义胜利。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>全胜</strong>：让敌国、敌军完整归顺，己方几乎零损耗，是&quot;善之善者&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>破胜</strong>：击败对手但双方俱损，是次一等；惨胜的收益常被损耗抵消。</li>\n<li><strong>损耗不对称账</strong>：破坏标的会同时降低标的本身的价值，故&quot;破&quot;的代价被孙子明确计入胜负衡量。</li>\n<li><strong>实现路径</strong>：全胜并非空想，它有从伐谋、伐交到实力威慑的递进路径，前提是&quot;先胜&quot;之势。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：全胜思想本质上是关于<strong>博弈净收益</strong>的原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全-与-破-一对量化的优先序\">「全」与「破」：一对量化的优先序</h2><p>《谋攻》的原文并非泛泛而谈，而是给出了一个从大到小、层层对应的&quot;全/破&quot;序列。这是孙子把抽象目标落成可操作判据的关键。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规模单位</th>\n<th>上策（全）</th>\n<th>次策（破）</th>\n<th>兵力规模（约）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>国</td>\n<td>全国为上</td>\n<td>破国次之</td>\n<td>一国之力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>军</td>\n<td>全军为上</td>\n<td>破军次之</td>\n<td>12500 人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旅</td>\n<td>全旅为上</td>\n<td>破旅次之</td>\n<td>500 人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卒</td>\n<td>全卒为上</td>\n<td>破卒次之</td>\n<td>100 人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伍</td>\n<td>全伍为上</td>\n<td>破伍次之</td>\n<td>5 人</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（军、旅、卒、伍编制据周代军制，五人为伍、百人为卒、五百人为旅、万二千五百人为军；原文见<a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/620623787\">谋攻篇</a>。）</p>\n<p>为什么孙子要把同一原则在五个尺度上重申？因为&quot;全胜&quot;不是只针对国家的宏大叙事，而是一条<strong>自相似（fractal）的判据</strong>：无论你面对的是一个国、一支军，还是五个人的小队，&quot;使其完整地降服&quot;永远优于&quot;把它打烂&quot;。这条原则可放大也可缩小，正是它能跨越军事、商业、谈判的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么-破-是次优-损耗的不对称账\">为什么「破」是次优：损耗的不对称账</h2><p>孙子的全胜逻辑建立在一笔成本账上。攻破式胜利的代价，并不只是战场伤亡，而是一组叠加的隐性损耗：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[选择交战/攻破] --&gt; B[己方战损]&#10;    A --&gt; C[敌方资源被毁]&#10;    A --&gt; D[占领后治理成本]&#10;    A --&gt; E[后续报复与仇恨]&#10;    F[选择全胜/不战而屈] --&gt; G[完整接收人口与产能]&#10;    F --&gt; H[降低占领阻力]&#10;    F --&gt; I[威慑性收益]&#10;    B &amp; C &amp; D &amp; E --&gt; J[净收益被损耗吞噬]&#10;    G &amp; H &amp; I --&gt; K[净收益最大化]\">flowchart TD\n    A[选择交战/攻破] --&gt; B[己方战损]\n    A --&gt; C[敌方资源被毁]\n    A --&gt; D[占领后治理成本]\n    A --&gt; E[后续报复与仇恨]\n    F[选择全胜/不战而屈] --&gt; G[完整接收人口与产能]\n    F --&gt; H[降低占领阻力]\n    F --&gt; I[威慑性收益]\n    B &amp; C &amp; D &amp; E --&gt; J[净收益被损耗吞噬]\n    G &amp; H &amp; I --&gt; K[净收益最大化]</pre><p>若以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 表示胜利标的的总价值，以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>破</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{破}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">破</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示攻破带来的破坏损耗与治理成本，以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>全</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{全}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">全</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示达成全胜（谋略、外交、威慑）的代价，孙子的判断可形式化为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>净收益</mtext><mtext>全</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>全</mtext></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mtext>净收益</mtext><mtext>破</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>破</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>己</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{净收益}_{全} = V - C_{全} \\;&gt;\\; \\text{净收益}_{破} = (V - C_{破}) - L_{己}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净收益</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">全</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">全</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净收益</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">破</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">破</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">己</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>己</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{己}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">己</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为己方损耗。关键洞察在于：攻破不仅扣减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>破</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{破}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">破</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，还要再扣 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>己</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{己}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">己</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而全胜把这两项都压到接近零。&quot;百战百胜，非善之善者也；不战而屈人之兵，善之善者也&quot;——百战百胜在这个等式里仍是&quot;次优&quot;，因为它隐含了大量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>己</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{己}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">己</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>破</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{破}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">破</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全胜的实现路径-从理想到手段\">全胜的实现路径：从理想到手段</h2><p>全胜不是空想，它依赖一条由强到弱的手段链。理解这条链，才不会把&quot;全胜&quot;误读为&quot;消极避战&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路径</th>\n<th>作用机制</th>\n<th>典型代价</th>\n<th>与全胜的距离</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>伐谋</td>\n<td>破坏敌方战略意图，使其不战自溃</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伐交</td>\n<td>瓦解敌方同盟、孤立对手</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>威慑/示形</td>\n<td>以势压人，使敌知难而退</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伐兵</td>\n<td>野战决胜</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>远</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>攻城</td>\n<td>强攻坚城</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最远</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>手段链的前段（伐谋、伐交）正是 <a href=\"attacking-strategy\">上兵伐谋</a> 的主题；而&quot;以势压人&quot;依赖的造势、任势能力，则见 <a href=\"../form-and-momentum/orthodox-and-unorthodox\">奇正之变与形势</a>。本篇只需明确：全胜是<strong>目标</strong>，手段链是通向它的阶梯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式-把-全胜-误用的三种方式\">反模式：把「全胜」误用的三种方式</h2><p>全胜思想流传极广，也最容易被误读。识别反模式，比记住口号更重要。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>反模式一：以&quot;不战&quot;为借口的怯战。</strong> 全胜的&quot;不战&quot;是因为已通过谋略/外交使敌屈服，而非畏战不前。孙子在《九变》中同样强调&quot;必死可杀&quot;之外有&quot;必生可虏&quot;，回避必要决战同样是败亡之道。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式二：把全胜当成&quot;零成本&quot;。</strong> 全胜降低的是破坏性损耗，但伐谋、伐交本身需要长期的情报、外交与实力积累。没有&quot;知彼知己&quot;（见 <a href=\"../knowing-and-calculating/know-yourself-know-enemy\">知彼知己的方法论</a>）与&quot;五事七计&quot;（见 <a href=\"../knowing-and-calculating/the-five-factors\">五事七计</a>）的庙算支撑，全胜只是侥幸。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式三：在不可调和的对抗中强求全胜。</strong> 当对方的目标就是消灭你时，&quot;使其完整降服&quot;不可得，此时执着全胜反而贻误战机。全胜是<strong>优先项而非唯一项</strong>，孙子的层次论正是为此保留了伐兵、攻城作为兜底。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"跨域价值-从战场到博弈论\">跨域价值：从战场到博弈论</h2><p>全胜思想之所以历久弥新，是因为它本质上是一条关于<strong>博弈净收益</strong>的原则，与现代博弈论中的&quot;非零和合作解&quot;高度相通。在商业并购中，&quot;全国为上&quot;对应着保全目标公司组织与团队完整性的收购优于敌意拆解；在谈判中，&quot;不战而屈人之兵&quot;对应着通过信息优势与立场塑造使对方自愿让步，而非陷入两败俱伤的消耗。</p>\n<p>这种跨域迁移并非牵强附会：孙子的损耗不对称账，在任何&quot;破坏标的会同时降低标的价值&quot;的对抗里都成立。这也是孙子思想被纳入商业战略、危机谈判课程的根本原因——详见 <a href=\"../../influence-and-legacy/global-influence/\">全球影响</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>&quot;全胜&quot;是孙子军事思想的顶层目标：以&quot;全&quot;（敌方完整归顺、己方零损耗）为上，以&quot;破&quot;（战胜但双方俱损）为次，甚至&quot;百战百胜&quot;也不及&quot;不战而屈人之兵&quot;。</li>\n<li>它对胜利的定义加入了成本维度：破坏标的会同时降低标的价值，故&quot;破&quot;的损耗必须计入胜负衡量。</li>\n<li>全胜不是空想，而是有实现路径的——它依赖伐谋、伐交等非暴力手段，并以&quot;先胜&quot;的实力与态势为前提。</li>\n<li>应警惕把全胜误用的三种方式：当成不必备战、泛化为凡事忍让、神化为万能。</li>\n<li>全胜的跨域价值在于它本质是一条博弈净收益原则，与现代博弈论的非零和合作解、商业并购与谈判策略相通。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>延伸阅读：本篇阐述全胜的&quot;目标&quot;层面，手段层面见 <a href=\"attacking-strategy\">上兵伐谋</a>；全胜在孙子整体战略哲学中的定位，见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/strategic-philosophy/\">核心贡献·战略哲学</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"全胜思想：不战而屈人之兵","id":"全胜思想-不战而屈人之兵"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"「全」与「破」：一对量化的优先序","id":"全-与-破-一对量化的优先序"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么「破」是次优：损耗的不对称账","id":"为什么-破-是次优-损耗的不对称账"},{"level":2,"text":"全胜的实现路径：从理想到手段","id":"全胜的实现路径-从理想到手段"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式：把「全胜」误用的三种方式","id":"反模式-把-全胜-误用的三种方式"},{"level":2,"text":"跨域价值：从战场到博弈论","id":"跨域价值-从战场到博弈论"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"上兵伐谋：手段的优先次序","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/supreme-strategy/attacking-strategy"}}